From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jason Perlow <jperlow@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 22:19:18 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 81/83] drm: cix: fix 6.6->7.2 API drift in linlon-dp + dptx

- drm_atomic_state renamed to drm_atomic_commit treewide
- private-obj init migrated to .atomic_create_state (from NCZ 9006)
- fbdev_generic -> drm_client_setup + DRM_FBDEV_DMA_DRIVER_OPS;
  drop drm_driver .lastclose/.date
- fb_create/fill_fb_struct take const drm_format_info
- connector mode_valid takes const display_mode
- MST: add_payload_part2 2-arg, remove_payload split part1/part2,
  drm_dp_get_vc_payload_bw fixed20_12 pbn_div
- drm_panel_init -> devm_drm_panel_alloc (edp panel)
- drm_panel_{prepare,enable,disable,unprepare} return void
- from_timer -> timer_container_of, del_timer -> timer_delete
- hdmi codec get_dai_id gains data arg; debugfs/of includes
- linlon-dp Makefile: $(srctree)/$(src) -> $(src) include paths
- color format enums -> BIT(DRM_OUTPUT_COLOR_FORMAT_*)
